{"id":"fe7fc55a6cc6c51834a574c150f932257e986646","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230061","title":"感觉 codex gpt-5.6 sol 现在也就之前 5.5 的水准","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"yellowsky","excerpt":"OpenAI - @yellowsky - 最近使用明显感觉 5.6 比之前下降了很多，也就之前 5.5 的水准，甚至比 5.5 最开始还差了一些,每次的新模型总是出道即巅峰。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>最近使用明显感觉 5.6 比之前下降了很多，也就之前 5.5 的水准，甚至比 5.5 最开始还差了一些,每次的新模型总是出道即巅峰。</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/Codex\"><li></li> Codex</a><a href=\"/tag/性能\"><li></li> 性能</a><a href=\"/tag/下降\"><li></li> 下降</a></P><p><span>15 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-07-28 08:16:19 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17906727\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d7ea/d549/11809_normal.png?m=1590386952\" alt=\"Bluecoda\" data-uid=\"11809\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Bluecoda\">Bluecoda</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 11:11:51 +08:00\">21h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>每隔一段时间就会有这类言论出来，其实基本都是 context 污染导致的问题。compact 过几次后，context 一堆垃圾内容，又想要 model 保持足够聪明，属于既要又要了，gpt10 来了都不好使。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17906738\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/52dd/3cb9/678967_normal.png?m=1735207570\" alt=\"yellowsky\" data-uid=\"678967\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yellowsky\">yellowsky</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 11:13:42 +08:00\">21h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Bluecoda\">Bluecoda</a> 我确定不是压缩后的污染，新会话修复一些简单的问题，都无法一次通过了，这在 5.5 时期都很少出现</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17906749\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0ba1/9930/629266_normal.png?m=1763349070\" alt=\"Sh15\" data-uid=\"629266\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sh15\">Sh15</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 11:16:06 +08:00\">21h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>5.5 刚出和后面，确实降智很严重</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17907202\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1659f799f25028c21f86420116c4ee50?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zhuomu\" data-uid=\"469149\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhuomu\">zhuomu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 12:51:45 +08:00\">19h 47m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>个人体验：5.6 sol high 稳定输出</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17907245\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f23f/09d0/281444_normal.png?m=1745647526\" alt=\"Oktfolio\" data-uid=\"281444\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Oktfolio\">Oktfolio</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 13:05:34 +08:00\">19h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Free 的 5.6 Terra 今天给我的感觉甚至不如 5.2</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17907281\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bb04/287a/571976_normal.png?m=1644217119\" alt=\"hellopz\" data-uid=\"571976\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hellopz\">hellopz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 13:13:31 +08:00\">19h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>个人感觉：无降智，一天用完 20x 周额度的过程中都无降智，最近一周也无降智</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17907415\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/382f/1f51/414567_normal.png?m=1691026308\" alt=\"cheng6563\" data-uid=\"414567\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cheng6563\">cheng6563</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 13:39:32 +08:00\">18h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>5.5 后期，指令理解能力还不如 deepseek 。<br>同一句提示词指令理解的和 sb 一样，切到 deepseek 都能正确理解。<br>都是些偷偷降智的玩意。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17908535\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9a958110f2517fec47184b50f3ef6210?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"thinkinside\" data-uid=\"605174\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/thinkinside\">thinkinside</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 16:37:34 +08:00\">16h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>个人感觉：降智明显<br>新开会话也一样。</p><p>（官方 plus 订阅账号）</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17908718\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2f59b786fd9cd2ec2b95720531ebbe83?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Y25tIGxpdmlk\" data-uid=\"623288\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Y25tIGxpdmlk\">Y25tIGxpdmlk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 16:59:55 +08:00\">15h 39m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>一天到晚就是感觉感觉。</p><p>跟苹果手机更新一个 iOS 系统以后，每次都有些人说耗电增加啥的，全他妈玄学。</p><p>别凭感觉，拿出测试数据来</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17909076\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d493/39ba/402341_normal.png?m=1781396324\" alt=\"hanbaoji\" data-uid=\"402341\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hanbaoji\">hanbaoji</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 17:56:41 +08:00\">14h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>sol high 很稳定，比 5.5 强多了，没啥降智的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17910024\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/faa4/53ef/2988_normal.png?m=1785179564\" alt=\"chxwx0532\" data-uid=\"2988\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chxwx0532\">chxwx0532</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 03:21:45 +08:00\">5h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>当前时间 7-28 明显降智了，问模型训练截止时间是 25 年 12 月，这就是 5.5 模型</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17910056\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2aadd08fc12d1da753775aa0e381289b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yjiefl\" data-uid=\"559015\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yjiefl\">yjiefl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 06:21:24 +08:00\">2h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>个人感觉更强了，出错问题变少了<br>我还是感觉之前那个 5.3codex 干活很强。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17910111\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9a958110f2517fec47184b50f3ef6210?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"thinkinside\" data-uid=\"605174\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/thinkinside\">thinkinside</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 08:16:19 +08:00\">22 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/Y25tIGxpdmlk